WEBVTT

00:03:29.872 --> 00:03:32.875
and which we’re perfectly capable
of producing in Africa,

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:36.212
as well as shielding our elderly
and our vulnerable

00:03:36.212 --> 00:03:37.964
through the Ubuntu philosophy,

00:03:37.964 --> 00:03:39.590
as was practiced in Ethiopia.

00:03:40.174 --> 00:03:43.761
So what would have happened
had African countries mounted the response

00:03:43.761 --> 00:03:46.681
that was appropriate,
proportionate and sustainable?

00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:48.849
So, using public health policies,

00:03:48.849 --> 00:03:50.059
drawing on our strengths,

00:03:50.059 --> 00:03:51.102
our experience,

00:03:51.102 --> 00:03:52.770
our health systems,

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.230
our population demographics

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.314
and our way of life.

00:03:56.065 --> 00:03:57.775
Well, Sierra Leone did just this,

00:03:57.775 --> 00:04:00.695
going against the Western tide
of wholesale lockdown